<title>USA: New Valley Q1 oper shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>New Valley Q1 oper shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper Shr loss		   $2.84     loss	 $1.76</p>
<p> Oper Net loss		  11,213     loss	 5,612</p>
<p> Revs			     19,753		   31,985</p>
<p> Avg shrs			  9,578		    9,578</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 net loss was $10,341,000, or $2.75 per share, compared to a net loss of $4,884,000, or $1.68 per share, for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said Q1 1997 loss applicable to common shares was $26,321,000 compared to a loss of $16,067,000 for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Full name is New Valley Corp.</p>
</text>
